{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, עֲבַר","hw":"עֲבַר","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">עֲבַר</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m. region across, beyond (</strong>v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, עֵ֫בֶר\" href=\"/BDB,_עֵ֫בֶר\", dir=\"rtl\">I. עֵ֫בֶר</a>, √ <a data-ref=\"BDB, עָבַר\" href=\"/BDB,_עָבַר\", dir=\"rtl\">עָבַר</a><strong>)</strong>;—cstr. in phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲבַר(־)נַהֲרָה</span>, i.e. Syria (Scheft <sup>87</sup>): <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:10\" href=\"/Ezra.4.10\">Ezr 4:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:11\" href=\"/Ezra.4.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:17\" href=\"/Ezra.4.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:20\" href=\"/Ezra.4.20\">20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:3\" href=\"/Ezra.5.3\">5:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:6\" href=\"/Ezra.5.6\">6</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:6\" href=\"/Ezra.6.6\">6:6</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:8\" href=\"/Ezra.6.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:13\" href=\"/Ezra.6.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:21\" href=\"/Ezra.7.21\">7:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:25\" href=\"/Ezra.7.25\">25</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ נהרא</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:16\" href=\"/Ezra.4.16\">4:16</a>. cf. in Cilic. Aramaic, Cooke <sup>346</sup>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, עַד","prev":"BDB Aramaic, מַעֲבַד²"}